{
  "$comment": [
    "Copy to `.mcp.json` and fill in. `.mcp.json` is GITIGNORED so nobody's server paths or tokens",
    "travel with this repository.",
    "",
    "DO NOT declare a connector here that your organisation already provisions org-wide. Two entries",
    "pointing at the same endpoint give you duplicate toolsets and two auth states, and the symptom",
    "is a tool that works in one conversation and 401s in the next. Authenticate the org one instead.",
    "",
    "The skills need, at minimum:",
    "  - issue-tracker access (read issues, write comments) — for phases 1, 2, 5",
    "  - source-control access, READ ONLY — for phase 1's PR discovery and deploy watch",
    "",
    "Test-management access is NOT via MCP by default — it goes through scripts/tms-*.ts and",
    "TMS_TOKEN in .env. If your TMS ships an MCP server, prefer it and retire the scripts."
  ],
  "mcpServers": {
    "<issue-tracker-mcp-server>": {
      "type": "stdio",
      "command": "<COMMAND>",
      "args": ["<ARGS>"],
      "env": {}
    },
    "<source-control-mcp-server>": {
      "type": "stdio",
      "command": "<COMMAND>",
      "args": ["<ARGS>"],
      "env": {}
    }
  }
}
